#: ../../source/stamp/stp2.rst:127 ../../source/stamp/stp2.rst:252
msgid ""
"Button A toggles LDO output retention during shutdown (Off by default). "
"Button B cycles the power-on delay through 5, 10 and 15 seconds (5 "
"seconds by default). Button C (Shutdown) applies the setting, arms the "
"power-on timer and immediately shuts down STP2. Buttons are locked until "
"the countdown finishes."
msgstr ""
"按键 A 切换关机期间的 LDO 输出保持，默认关闭。按键 B 循环选择 5、10、15 秒开机延时，默认 5 秒。按键 "
"C（Shutdown）应用设置、启动定时开机并立即关闭 STP2。倒计时期间锁定按键。"

#: ../../source/stamp/stp2.rst:129 ../../source/stamp/stp2.rst:254
msgid ""
"Keep Basic independently powered so it can display the countdown while "
"STP2 is shut down."
msgstr "Basic 需独立供电，以便在 STP2 关机期间继续显示倒计时。"

#: ../../source/stamp/stp2.rst:131
