"High pulse width in nanoseconds; ``None`` reads it. The value cannot "
"exceed the current PWM period. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "高电平脉宽，单位 ns； ``None`` 表示读取。设置值不得超过当前 PWM 周期。 默认值：``None``。"

